From b89e3c8dd4feb4898a3a2dbeb144f32abcd754fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Goh, Wei Khang1" <wei.khang1.goh@intel.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 18:35:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 121/122] media: i2c: ar0234: Enable 1920x1200 @ 60fps mode

Add the 1920x1200 @ 60fps mode's PLL/MIPI/window-geometry register
sequence and refactor the common DDC/sequencer/AFE register blocks so
they are shared across modes instead of duplicated per mode. Also add
pixel rate reporting and update mc-setup.sh to print live fps.

Signed-off-by: Goh, Wei Khang1 <wei.khang1.goh@intel.com>
Signed-off-by: florent pirou <florent.pirou@intel.com>
---
